@{
    var commission = Helpers.ToInt32((Config.Masar.Commission * 100));
    var vat = Helpers.ToInt32((Config.Masar.Vat * 100));
    var support = Config.Masar.SupportEmail;
}

<div class="ms-dialog ms-legal" id="ms-terms" hidden>
  <div class="card pad" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-terms-h">
    <div class="ms-legal-h">
      <div><span class="m-eyebrow">Masar</span><h3 class="m-h3" id="ms-terms-h">Terms of use</h3></div>
      <button type="button" class="ms-x" data-ms-close aria-label="Close"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-legal-b">
      <h4 class="m-h4">1. What Masar is</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Masar introduces clients to verified experts in Saudi Arabia and holds the money
        until the work is done. The expert gives the advice or the service; Masar is not a party to it.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">2. Your account</h4>
      <p class="m-body">One account per person, with a real name, a reachable email and a Saudi mobile
        number. Keep your password to yourself. An expert account stays Pending until our team has read
        the licences and certificates that were uploaded.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">3. What you pay</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Every price on Masar is shown in full before you confirm: the expert's price, a
        @(commission)% platform commission and @(vat)% VAT on the price. Nothing is charged until
        you press the pay button, and the amount on the invoice is the amount you were shown.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">4. What the expert receives</h4>
      <p class="m-body">The expert receives the price less the @(commission)% commission. Masar holds
        it until the consultation or the service is marked completed, and releases it then.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">5. Changing your mind</h4>
      <p class="m-body">A consultation cancelled more than @(Config.Masar.FreeCancelHours) hours
        before it starts is refunded in full. Later than that the session is kept. If the expert cancels,
        you are refunded in full whenever it happens.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">6. Behaviour</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Keep the conversation inside the booking, pay through Masar, and write reviews
        only about work you really bought. Accounts that go around the platform or abuse other people
        are blocked.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">7. Closing your account</h4>
      <p class="m-body">You can close your account at any time once no booking or proposal is still open.
        Your email and phone number are anonymised; invoices and reviews stay, because they belong to the
        other side of the deal too.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">8. Questions</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Write to @(support) and we answer within one working day. These terms follow
        the laws of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-legal-f">
      <p class="m-small">Last updated @(Clock.Now.Format("j F Y"))</p>
      <button type="button" class="m-btn m-btn-primary" data-ms-close>I have read this</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ms-dialog ms-legal" id="ms-privacy" hidden>
  <div class="card pad" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-privacy-h">
    <div class="ms-legal-h">
      <div><span class="m-eyebrow">Masar</span><h3 class="m-h3" id="ms-privacy-h">Privacy policy</h3></div>
      <button type="button" class="ms-x" data-ms-close aria-label="Close"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-legal-b">
      <h4 class="m-h4">1. What we keep</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Your name, email, phone number and city; your photo if you upload one; and for an
        expert, the specialization, experience, bio and the verification documents our team reads.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">2. What the work creates</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Your bookings, service requests, proposals, messages, files, payments and reviews
        are stored so that both sides of a deal can look them up later.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">3. Who can see it</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Your name, city and photo are visible to the expert you book, and an expert's
        public profile is visible to everyone. Messages and files are visible only inside that booking.
        Our admins can see what they need to verify experts and settle payments. Verification documents
        are never shown to clients.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">4. Card details</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Masar never stores a full card number. A payment keeps only the method, the last
        four digits and the amount, so you can recognise it on an invoice.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">5. Email</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Masar does not send marketing email. Everything that happens on your account is
        shown in the notifications bell when you log in.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">6. How long</h4>
      <p class="m-body">Anything with a payment attached is kept for the period Saudi accounting rules
        require. Everything else is removed or anonymised when you close your account.</p>

      <h4 class="m-h4">7. Your choices</h4>
      <p class="m-body">You can read and correct your details on your profile page at any time, and ask
        us for a copy or for a correction at @(support).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-legal-f">
      <p class="m-small">Last updated @(Clock.Now.Format("j F Y"))</p>
      <button type="button" class="m-btn m-btn-primary" data-ms-close>I have read this</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
